#, fuzzy
msgid "SmallRye Fault Tolerance"
msgstr "SmallRye Tolerancia a fallos"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"One of the challenges brought by the distributed nature of microservices is that communication with external systems is\n"
"inherently unreliable. This increases demand on resiliency of applications. To simplify making more resilient\n"
"applications, Quarkus provides https://github.com/smallrye/smallrye-fault-tolerance/[SmallRye Fault Tolerance], an\n"
"implementation of the https://github.com/eclipse/microprofile-fault-tolerance/[MicroProfile Fault Tolerance]\n"
"specification."
msgstr "Uno de los retos que plantea la naturaleza distribuida de los microservicios es que la comunicación con los sistemas externos es intrínsecamente poco fiable. Esto aumenta la demanda de resiliencia de las aplicaciones. Para simplificar la creación de aplicaciones más resistentes, Quarkus proporciona link:https://github.com/smallrye/smallrye-fault-tolerance/[SmallRye Fault Tolerance] , una implementación de la especificación link:https://github.com/eclipse/microprofile-fault-tolerance/[MicroProfile Fault Tolerance] ."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In this guide, we demonstrate usage of MicroProfile Fault Tolerance annotations such as `@Timeout`, `@Fallback`,\n"
"`@Retry`, `@CircuitBreaker`, and `@RateLimit`."
msgstr "En esta guía, demostramos el uso de anotaciones de tolerancia a fallos de MicroProfile como `@Timeout` , `@Fallback` , `@Retry` , `@CircuitBreaker` , y `@RateLimit` ."

